{"version":1,"key":"card:423","content":{"id":423,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0b66cbdf-822e-4a7f-af2d-ce378cd6b7ef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在软件开发，我们经常被教导要面向接口，而不是面向实现，开发时我们不需要考虑具体的实现，只使用接口规定的功能就可以，即使后续由于架构升级或者性能考虑，修改了具体的实现，只要对外提供的接口不变，依赖方便不需要进行任何的修改。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e17701c2-65e0-466a-83f5-44571c24a923","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是 Google 工程师 Hyrum 在他的书中《Software Engineering at Google》提出："}]},{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"747a2044-b16b-4af9-9248-d4e25f04a451","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3b94561d-197a-4dce-8435-e41eaec8f9d4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"With a sufficient number of users of an API, it does not matter what you promise in the contract: all observable behaviors of your system will be depended on by somebody."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7d947b77-f983-4838-99f0-42448a8f6e71","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"总而言之，只要使用接口的用户足够多，总会有某些人依赖你接口未规定，但是可以被观测到的行为，即依赖了具体的实现，使得你的所有可观测行为被强迫成为了接口的一部分，这个定律被称为 Hyrum's Law。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"77263377-9a30-4644-888f-fef22e8d3411","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于依赖了实现，如果由于某些原因需要修改实现，为了实现向后兼容，在改变实现细节的情况下还需要保证与之前的实现细节暴露的行为保持一致，bug for bug，这使得改变实现的成本非常高。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8bf22344-4889-4c4d-ae9c-1ae9b6cbaaaa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"dd8f0ec7-38d8-4f99-a342-07ba128aa24c","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2bde4361-6374-4b93-87a1-6fdc6b0e2236","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"602ddb0a-2c86-489b-9611-8bc19f4726b5","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://github.com/qiwihui/pocket_readings/issues/1050","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"5b8ba338-2e1f-4aea-9e00-7cda4519bc58","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"计算机领域的三个重要思想：抽象，分层和高阶"}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["软件开发"],"createTime":1712456190158,"updateTime":1763390427270,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1763390427270}}